From: =?UTF-8?q?Bj=C3=B8rn=20Inge=20Berg?= <bjorninge-git@bjorninge.no>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:39:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Pair with libre2sim in the iOS Simulator

The Simulator has no NFC, so Libre 2 pairing there talks to libre2sim's
HTTP stand-in for the sensor's NFC tag (LIBRE2SIM_URL, default
http://127.0.0.1:8081) instead of CoreNFC.

The enable-streaming command is factored out of SensorPairingService into
Libre2NFC so both services build identical bytes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
